      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "9. A replica sends response(r1, ok)\nSimulator::on_response updates:\n  history[r1].complete = true\n  history[r1].end = now\n  history[r1].result = ok\n  sessions[client].through = 1",
      "textAlign": "left",
