    {
      "id": "pending-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440.23046875,
      "y": 184.76953125,
      "width": 467.9395751953125,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 142,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1981877417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793498421056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Important: there is no single\n\"pending commands\" list\n\nDifferent state answers different questions:\n\nSimulator::history\n  Is the CLIENT still waiting?\n\nn1.proposers[slot]\n  Is n1 driving consensus? At what step?\n\neachNode.recorders[slot]\n  What proposal evidence has this node seen?\n\nSimulator::messages\n  What work/evidence is still in flight?\n\nNode::decisions[slot]\n  Has this replica learned the chosen value?\n\nNode::applied/config/results\n  Has this replica applied it locally?\n\nThese moments need not happen simultaneously.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Important: there is no single\n\"pending commands\" list\n\nDifferent state answers different questions:\n\nSimulator::history\n  Is the CLIENT still waiting?\n\nn1.proposers[slot]\n  Is n1 driving consensus? At what step?\n\neachNode.recorders[slot]\n  What proposal evidence has this node seen?\n\nSimulator::messages\n  What work/evidence is still in flight?\n\nNode::decisions[slot]\n  Has this replica learned the chosen value?\n\nNode::applied/config/results\n  Has this replica applied it locally?\n\nThese moments need not happen simultaneously.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "af"
    },
    {
      "id": "separation-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1412.4765625,
      "y": 831.02734375,
      "width": 523.76953125,
      "height": 481.64062499999994,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
