      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Color key\n\nYELLOW  client boundary\n\nBLUE    observer/client bookkeeping\n        (not consensus evidence)\n\nPURPLE  private QuePaxa protocol state\n\nORANGE  messages in the simulated network\n\nGREEN   per-replica application state",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Color key\n\nYELLOW  client boundary\n\nBLUE    observer/client bookkeeping\n        (not consensus evidence)\n\nPURPLE  private QuePaxa protocol state\n\nORANGE  messages in the simulated network\n\nGREEN   per-replica application state",
